  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto Launches Studio Guru Program On National Teacher Day",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto Launches Studio Guru Program On National…",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto unveiled the Studio Guru program and reported Rp90.8 trillion in teacher allowances during National Teacher Day in Bogor.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto officially inaugurated the digital learning initiative known as Studio Guru during the National Teacher Day celebration.",
    "The government disclosed that it disbursed Rp90.85 trillion in total allowances for both civil servant and non-civil servant teachers throughout 2026.",
    "Proposed educational reforms include a plan to send 3,350 teachers for international training in Canada and Russia starting in 2027."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "During the peak commemoration of National Teacher Day 2026 held at the Sentul International Convention Center in Bogor, West Java, President Prabowo Subianto announced several major initiatives aimed at improving Indonesia's educational sector. Alongside Coordinating Minister for Human Development and Culture Sugiono and Minister of Primary and Secondary Education Abdul Mu'ti, the President launched the Studio Guru program, a centralized platform designed to broadcast lessons from high-performing teachers to regions facing educator shortages. Additionally, the President detailed that the government distributed Rp90.85 trillion in teacher allowances between January and November 2026, comprising Rp70.64 trillion for civil servants and Rp20.21 trillion for non-civil servant teachers. Future plans mentioned by the administration include refurbishing 200,000 schools and sending thousands of teachers abroad for professional development, beginning with Canada and Russia in 2027.",
  "whyItIsViral": "The event generated high interest across national media outlets, driven by significant financial announcements and new digital education initiatives involving the President.",
